Package: fastmed
Type: Package
Title: Mediation Analysis with Selected Column Prefixes Using Parallel Processing
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-01-02
Authors@R: person("Daehwan", "Kim", email = "kdh5358@snu.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Author: Daehwan Kim [aut, cre, cph]
Maintainer: Daehwan Kim <kdh5358@snu.ac.kr>
Description: Performs high-performance batch mediation analysis using generalized
    linear models (Gaussian, Binomial, and Poisson families) with support for
    quasi-Bayesian (asymptotic) simulation and bootstrap resampling methods.
    Supports flexible column prefix matching for mediators and outcomes, and
    leverages C++ parallel processing via 'RcppParallel' for efficient computation
    on large datasets.
URL: https://github.com/daehwankim12/fastmed
